TI  - EFFECTS OF SUSPENDED SEDIMENTS ON CORAL GROWTH - EVIDENCE FROM REMOTE-SENSING AND HYDROLOGIC MODELING
T2  - REMOTE SENSING OF ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - CARIBBEAN REEF CORALS
KW  - MONTASTRAEA-ANNULARIS
