TI  - Declining Coral Skeletal Extension for Forereef Colonies of Siderastrea siderea on the Mesoamerican Barrier Reef System, Southern Belize
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - SEA-SURFACE TEMPERATURE
KW  - MARINE ECOLOGY
KW  - CLIMATE-CHANGE
