TI  - Exposure of inshore corals to suspended sediments due to wave-resuspension and river plumes in the central Great Barrier Reef: A reappraisal
T2  - CONTINENTAL SHELF RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Great Barrier Reef
KW  - Sediment
KW  - Wave resuspension
KW  - River plume
KW  - EEL CONTINENTAL-SLOPE
