TI  - A new ROV storage device for deep-sea sampling
T2  - ANAIS DA ACADEMIA BRASILEIRA DE CIENCIAS
LA  - English
KW  - Associated fauna
KW  - sampling box
KW  - corals
KW  - octocorals
KW  - rhodoliths
