TI  - Groundwater discharge and streams drive spatial alkalinity and pCO2 dynamics in two contrasting tropical lagoons
T2  - MARINE CHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - Submarine groundwater discharge
KW  - Eutrophication
KW  - Pacific Islands
KW  - Aragonite
KW  - Ocean acidification
