TI  - A new species of the hermit crab genus Cancellus H. Milne Edwards, 1836 from a mesophotic deep bank in the northwestern Gulf of Mexico (Crustacea: Decapoda: Diogenidae)
T2  - ZOOTAXA
LA  - English
KW  - new species
KW  - Anomura
KW  - Cancellus
