TI  - DISTRIBUTION OF SEDIMENTS ASSOCIATED WITH DREDGING ACTIVITIES ON SOUTH CHINA SEA DETECTED BY VIIRS ON SUOMI-NPP
T2  - IGARSS 2018 - 2018 IEEE INTERNATIONAL GEOSCIENCE AND REMOTE SENSING SYMPOSIUM
