TI  - Accounting for environmental uncertainty in the management of dredging impacts using probabilistic dose-response relationships and thresholds
T2  - JOURNAL OF APPLIED ECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - coral mortality
KW  - coral reefs
KW  - dose-response
KW  - dredging
