TI  - Links between fish community structure and habitat complexity of a rocky reef in the Gulf of California threatened by development: Implications for mitigation measures
T2  - OCEAN & COASTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Fish community
KW  - Gulf of California
KW  - Habitat complexity
KW  - Habitat modification
KW  - Rocky reef
KW  - CORAL-REEF
KW  - PATCH REEFS
KW  - ASSEMBLAGES
KW  - DIVERSITY
