TI  - TAPHONOMY OF BACKSHORE VERSUS DEEP-MARINE COLLECTED NAUTILUS MACROMPHALUS CONCHS (NEW CALEDONIA)
T2  - PALAIOS
LA  - English
KW  - LOYALTY ISLANDS
KW  - SHELLS
KW  - BIOEROSION
