TI  - Coral Reefs of the Red Sea with Special Reference to the Sudanese Coastal Area
T2  - RED SEA: THE FORMATION, MORPHOLOGY, OCEANOGRAPHY AND ENVIRONMENT OF A YOUNG OCEAN BASIN
LA  - English
