TI  - Can giant clam (Tridacna squamosa) populations be restored on Singapore's heavily impacted coral reefs?
T2  - AQUATIC CONSERVATION-MARINE AND FRESHWATER ECOSYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - conservation
KW  - coral reef
KW  - giant clam
KW  - growth
KW  - survey
